# Backend quality gate

When you edit files under `backend/`, run the local checks before ending the task.

From `backend/`:

```bash
python -m ruff check app tests --fix
python -m ruff format app tests
python -m ruff check app tests
python -m ruff format --check app tests
python -m mypy app
python -m pytest --cov=app --cov-report=term-missing --cov-fail-under=90
```

When PostgreSQL is available:

```bash
python -m alembic upgrade head
python -m alembic check
```

- Match CI: [`.github/workflows/backend-ci.yml`](../../.github/workflows/backend-ci.yml).
- Full contract: [`docs/backend/GLOBAL.md`](../../docs/backend/GLOBAL.md).
- Do not replace PostgreSQL integration checks with SQLite.
